Scope: One memo per meeting, from the one notes file named in the request: the decisions made and the actions (who does what, by when), including commitments that someone voiced in prose. Nothing else: no attendee list, no discussion recap.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-e7-s1-1792911600/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
Reports to: lead

